{
 "about": "Customization entries with the fields domain, component, type, tenantId and externalId (fields of a set), entries naming another tenant, an effective set the upload would refuse, and the level and recursive parameters of the import and the delete. Each case asks before and after; the read rule allows READ, the update rule never holds.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R29ST_",
